{
    "title": "JobGet: Job Search",
    "description": "<h2><b>Top Job Search App - with one click apply!</b></h2>\r\n\r\nGet a job in 24 hours! JobGet is the fastest way to find jobs near you and get hired.\r\n\r\n <b><h2>Fastest Job Search</h2></b> \r\n\r\nFinding a job near you shouldn\u2019t take hours filling out online applications and waiting weeks to hear back. JobGet has created a job search marketplace where employers and job seekers can instantly message each other, schedule meetings, or even video interviews, all within minutes!\r\n\r\nJobGet is the fastest job search platform for anyone looking for jobs in retail, hospitality, food service, warehouse, cleaning and so much more! Our app takes the traditional job searching timeline from weeks to just minutes. Whether you are building a career or searching for full-time, flexible, part-time, contract, internship, gig, temp, shifts, work from home or hourly jobs, JobGet is the fastest job search app to get hired!\r\n\r\nJobGet provides a comprehensive job search with everything you are looking for - a variety of local jobs, one-click apply, and instant connection. Download JobGet now and start applying to jobs near you!\r\n\r\n<b><h2>Job Search With 1-Click Apply</h2></b> \r\n\r\n1. CREATE A PROFILE IN SECONDS\r\nNo resume, no problem! Our free resume builder will make one for you. Simply create a profile in less than 60 seconds, and you\u2019re ready to start applying.\r\n\r\n2. 1-CLICK APPLICATION\r\nFind jobs hiring near you and apply with 1-click! Hear back within 24 hours and get hired!\r\n\r\n3. CHAT WITH HIRING MANAGERS\r\nChat with employers directly in the app through instant messages. Ask questions, learn more about the job, and even have a video interview in the app!  \r\n\r\n************************ \r\n\r\n<b><h2>Hiring? Find Top Candidates in Three Quick Steps</h2></b>  \r\n\r\n1. CREATE A JOB POSTING FOR FREE IN SECONDS\r\nCreate a simple profile in less than 60 seconds, and start sourcing top candidates ASAP.\r\n\r\n2. QUICKLY FILTER THROUGH THE TOP APPLICANTS\r\nNo more going through long and indistinguishable resumes! Filter by experience quickly and find quality candidate profiles.\r\n\r\n3. CHAT INSTANTLY WITH CANDIDATES\r\nChat with job seekers directly in the app through instant messaging. Set up in-person interviews or even video interviews instantly in the app!\r\n\r\n************************ \r\n\r\n<b><h2>Discover Company Reviews Within the App</h2></b>\r\n\r\n1.EXPLORE COMPANY REVIEWS\r\nExplore authentic company reviews shared by other users. Get a sense of the work culture, environment, benefits, and more before you decide to apply.\r\n\r\n2.SHARE YOUR EXPERIENCE\r\nHad a job interview or worked for a company listed on JobGet? Share your insights and experiences to help other job seekers make informed decisions. Whether it is about the working hours, team dynamics, or management style \u2013 your feedback matters!\r\n\r\n************************\r\n\r\n<b><h2>Top Job Finder</h2></b> \r\n\r\nJobGet is the fastest and most effective job search app, helping you find your next job. Access hundreds of thousands of jobs and companies with a one-click application process. \r\n\r\nWe are active in most major cities across the US. Here are just some of the job categories that you can find on our job search app:\r\n- Restaurant jobs\r\n- Hospitality jobs\r\n- Warehouse jobs\r\n- Retail jobs\r\n- General Labor jobs\r\n- Personal Care jobs\r\n- Cleaning jobs\r\n- Delivery and Driver jobs\r\n- Sales and Marketing jobs\r\n- Bartender and Barista jobs\r\n- Customer Service jobs\r\n- Chef and Cook jobs\r\n- Healthcare and nurse jobs\r\n- Babysitting and nanny jobs\r\n- Caregiver and dog walking jobs\r\n- Remote and online jobs\r\n- Teen jobs\r\n- Daily paid jobs\r\n\r\nLooking for more ways to earn cash? Check out our opportunities for side hustles while searching for your next job opportunity. These side hustles include DoorDash, Uber, Instacart, Shipt, Care.com and many more!\r\n\r\n************************ \r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.jobget.com/privacypolicy.html\r\nTerms and Conditions: https://www.jobget.com/termsconditions.html \r\n\r\nHave a question? Want to share some feedback? We\u2019d love to hear from you! \r\nEmail us at support@jobget.com!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h2><b>Top Job Search App - with one click apply!</b></h2><br><br>Get a job in 24 hours! JobGet is the fastest way to find jobs near you and get hired.<br><br> <b><h2>Fastest Job Search</h2></b> <br><br>Finding a job near you shouldn\u2019t take hours filling out online applications and waiting weeks to hear back. JobGet has created a job search marketplace where employers and job seekers can instantly message each other, schedule meetings, or even video interviews, all within minutes!<br><br>JobGet is the fastest job search platform for anyone looking for jobs in retail, hospitality, food service, warehouse, cleaning and so much more! Our app takes the traditional job searching timeline from weeks to just minutes. Whether you are building a career or searching for full-time, flexible, part-time, contract, internship, gig, temp, shifts, work from home or hourly jobs, JobGet is the fastest job search app to get hired!<br><br>JobGet provides a comprehensive job search with everything you are looking for - a variety of local jobs, one-click apply, and instant connection. Download JobGet now and start applying to jobs near you!<br><br><b><h2>Job Search With 1-Click Apply</h2></b> <br><br>1. CREATE A PROFILE IN SECONDS<br>No resume, no problem! Our free resume builder will make one for you. Simply create a profile in less than 60 seconds, and you\u2019re ready to start applying.<br><br>2. 1-CLICK APPLICATION<br>Find jobs hiring near you and apply with 1-click! Hear back within 24 hours and get hired!<br><br>3. CHAT WITH HIRING MANAGERS<br>Chat with employers directly in the app through instant messages. Ask questions, learn more about the job, and even have a video interview in the app!  <br><br>************************ <br><br><b><h2>Hiring? Find Top Candidates in Three Quick Steps</h2></b>  <br><br>1. CREATE A JOB POSTING FOR FREE IN SECONDS<br>Create a simple profile in less than 60 seconds, and start sourcing top candidates ASAP.<br><br>2. QUICKLY FILTER THROUGH THE TOP APPLICANTS<br>No more going through long and indistinguishable resumes! Filter by experience quickly and find quality candidate profiles.<br><br>3. CHAT INSTANTLY WITH CANDIDATES<br>Chat with job seekers directly in the app through instant messaging. Set up in-person interviews or even video interviews instantly in the app!<br><br>************************ <br><br><b><h2>Discover Company Reviews Within the App</h2></b><br><br>1.EXPLORE COMPANY REVIEWS<br>Explore authentic company reviews shared by other users. Get a sense of the work culture, environment, benefits, and more before you decide to apply.<br><br>2.SHARE YOUR EXPERIENCE<br>Had a job interview or worked for a company listed on JobGet? Share your insights and experiences to help other job seekers make informed decisions. Whether it is about the working hours, team dynamics, or management style \u2013 your feedback matters!<br><br>************************<br><br><b><h2>Top Job Finder</h2></b> <br><br>JobGet is the fastest and most effective job search app, helping you find your next job. Access hundreds of thousands of jobs and companies with a one-click application process. <br><br>We are active in most major cities across the US. Here are just some of the job categories that you can find on our job search app:<br>- Restaurant jobs<br>- Hospitality jobs<br>- Warehouse jobs<br>- Retail jobs<br>- General Labor jobs<br>- Personal Care jobs<br>- Cleaning jobs<br>- Delivery and Driver jobs<br>- Sales and Marketing jobs<br>- Bartender and Barista jobs<br>- Customer Service jobs<br>- Chef and Cook jobs<br>- Healthcare and nurse jobs<br>- Babysitting and nanny jobs<br>- Caregiver and dog walking jobs<br>- Remote and online jobs<br>- Teen jobs<br>- Daily paid jobs<br><br>Looking for more ways to earn cash? Check out our opportunities for side hustles while searching for your next job opportunity. These side hustles include DoorDash, Uber, Instacart, Shipt, Care.com and many more!<br><br>************************ <br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.jobget.com/privacypolicy.html<br>Terms and Conditions: https://www.jobget.com/termsconditions.html <br><br>Have a question? Want to share some feedback? We\u2019d love to hear from you! <br>Email us at support@jobget.com!",
